v1|craft-cold-start-index
=STATE
craft is installed; this project is NOT initialized (no .craft/ state). Most craft machinery is dormant until /craft:init. Route to what works now.
=WORKS-NOW
mock something up / see visual options|/craft:mockup - full funnel runs cold; persists under repo-root .craft/mockups/; its closing step offers init
dial a live value on the running app|/craft:dial - runs cold against a running app; files no record; mentions init only at the close
capture a thought|/craft:notebook - capture works cold, lands at repo-root .craft/notebook/
deferral marker in user utterance ("later"/"don't let me forget"/"side note"/etc.)|inline-mention /craft:notebook (NOT AskUserQuestion); on accept capture silently
how does craft work / which flow fits|/craft:guide (explains) | /craft:ask (expert consult) | /craft:riff (thinking partner) - all run cold
research a question|/craft:research - runs cold, artifacts at repo-root .craft/research/
crystallize an expert agent|/craft:become - runs cold, artifacts at repo root
=NEEDS-INIT
build a feature / plan a story / start a cycle|offer /craft:init FIRST, before any story-shaped planning
fix or tweak existing work (adhoc)|offer /craft:init first - fix/tweak records live in .craft/
=RULES
+route to what works now; never block a cold activity to demand init
+graduate moments (mockup close, notes accumulating, research finished): recommend /craft:init actively, with the accumulated work in hand - init makes it recallable, buildable, tracked
!never auto-run /craft:init - always offer, user decides
